flowchart TD
    A["🔍 User enters origin and destination"] --> B["🔍 User presses search"]
    B --> C["📱 App shows carousel of options"]
    C --> D{"🤔 User explores options<br/>in carousel?"}
    D -->|Yes| E["🗺️ Map shows preview<br/>with centered zoom"]
    E --> F{"🚌 Is there an ETA for<br/>the first stop?"}
    F -->|Yes| G["🚌 Real-time bus shown<br/>+ green segment to stop"]
    F -->|No| H["📍 Only basic preview shown"]
    G --> I["▶️ User selects option<br/>and starts trip"]
    H --> I
    D -->|No| I
    
    I --> J["🎯 ACTIVE TRIP START<br/>Real-time bus polling"]
    J --> K["🚶‍♂️ STEP 1: Walk to stop"]
    K --> L["📍 Location every 5s + blue segment<br/>+ distance widget + progress"]
    L --> M{"📍 Did user reach<br/>the stop?"}
    M -->|No| L
    M -->|Yes| N["🚏 STEP 2: Wait for bus"]
    
    N --> O{"🚌 Is there an ETA<br/>available?"}
    O -->|No| P["📍 Map focuses on stop<br/>+ shows line to wait for"]
    O -->|Yes| Q["🚌 Map focuses on stop + bus<br/>+ dynamic zoom stop-bus"]
    
    P --> R["⏱️ Location monitor every 5s<br/>Did user move on bus leg?"]
    Q --> S["⏱️ Location monitor every 5s<br/>Did user move on bus leg?"]
    
    R --> T{"🚌 Did user get on the bus?"}
    S --> U{"🚌 Did user get on the bus?"}
    T -->|No| R
    U -->|No| S
    
    T -->|Yes| V["🚌 STEP 3: On the bus<br/>Stop ETA polling<br/>User = bus location"]
    U -->|Yes| V
    
    V --> W["🗺️ Map focuses on destination stop<br/>+ user/bus location"]
    W --> X{"📍 Did user reach<br/>destination stop?"}
    X -->|No| W
    X -->|Yes| Y["🚶‍♂️ Default walking mode<br/>Next step"]
    
    Y --> Z{"🤔 Type of next step?"}
    Z -->|🚌 Wait for another bus| AA["🚏 Reuse bus waiting flow<br/>(like STEP 2)"]
    Z -->|🚶‍♂️ Walk to another stop| BB["🚶‍♂️ Reuse walking flow<br/>(like STEP 1)"]
    Z -->|🎯 Walk to final destination| CC["🚶‍♂️ Walk to final point<br/>(similar to STEP 1)"]
    
    AA --> DD["🔄 Continue with next step"]
    BB --> DD
    CC --> EE{"📍 Did user reach the<br/>final destination?"}
    EE -->|No| CC
    EE -->|Yes| FF["✅ TRIP FINISHED<br/>AUTOMATICALLY"]
    
    DD --> Y
    
    style A fill:#e1f5fe
    style J fill:#c8e6c9
    style K fill:#fff3e0
    style N fill:#f3e5f5
    style V fill:#e8f5e8
    style FF fill:#c8e6c9
